{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buff Climbers</strong> is a rogue-like platformer currently in development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or team up with friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both <u>local</u> and <u>online</u> multiplayer are supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in <strong>Buff Climbers</strong> is physically simulated. A single rock might roll onto a bomb and set off a chain reaction. A pot bouncing off a slime\u2019s head could trigger an avalanche. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t expect to survive your first expedition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience comes with death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the mountain as day turns into night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up camp at dusk, choose your path and your <strong>BUFFs</strong>, and prepare for a new set of dangers and rewards each day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With randomly generated floors and hazards, no two climbs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And don\u2019t forget the <u>loot</u>! The mountain lures climbers with promises of glory and riches. Spend your <u>gold</u> on <u>rare items</u> and powerful <strong>BUFFs</strong> to boost your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <i>can</i> climb together! But beware: some people are born griefers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still, it might be wise to bring a friend (or two). The mountain is tall and treacherous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Besides, they might carry your body to safety for a respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd7 <strong>Demo coming August 2025</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Full Release: Late 2025</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Wishlist now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798950?t=1749499647","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798950?t=1749499647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/bd301587d2c0c1c0c5c07348d60ea9090004b978/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749499647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/bd301587d2c0c1c0c5c07348d60ea9090004b978/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749499647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buff Climbers</strong> is a rogue-like platformer currently in development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or team up with friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both <u>local</u> and <u>online</u> multiplayer are supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in <strong>Buff Climbers</strong> is physically simulated. A single rock might roll onto a bomb and set off a chain reaction. A pot bouncing off a slime\u2019s head could trigger an avalanche. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t expect to survive your first expedition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience comes with death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the mountain as day turns into night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up camp at dusk, choose your path and your <strong>BUFFs</strong>, and prepare for a new set of dangers and rewards each day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With randomly generated floors and hazards, no two climbs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And don\u2019t forget the <u>loot</u>! The mountain lures climbers with promises of glory and riches. Spend your <u>gold</u> on <u>rare items</u> and powerful <strong>BUFFs</strong> to boost your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <i>can</i> climb together! But beware: some people are born griefers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still, it might be wise to bring a friend (or two). The mountain is tall and treacherous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Besides, they might carry your body to safety for a respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd7 <strong>Demo coming August 2025</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Full Release: Late 2025</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Wishlist now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["ArcadeNest"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/92980901c312afdeb6c4bcb6a378ab2321b4a9d0/header.jpg?t=1749499647","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151114,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151114/movie480.mp4?t=1749224765","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151114/movie_max.mp4?t=1749224765"},"